# Two input arms (sites 1 to 5 and 6 to 10) meet at site 11; the output arm runs from 11 to 16. With links of 0.03 into the junction one arriving pulse is not enough.
# Reference: the same network integrated independently (complex arithmetic, LSODA).
title Weak junction, first input only
sites 16
path 1 5 kappa=0.06
path 6 10 kappa=0.06
path 11 16 kappa=0.06
link 5 11 kappa=0.03
link 10 11 kappa=0.03
kick 1 amplitude=2
run 1200
expect total 5
expect last 81.83045 0.003
expect count 1 1
expect arrival 1 12.96038 0.003
expect peak 1 58.059000 2e-4
expect count 3 1
expect arrival 3 48.19734 0.003
expect peak 3 56.713447 2e-4
expect count 4 1
expect arrival 4 65.46869 0.003
expect peak 4 56.691659 2e-4
expect count 6 0
expect count 8 0
expect count 9 0
expect count 11 0
expect count 13 0
expect count 14 0
expect count 16 0
expect each 1 5 1
expect silent 6 16
